2026-07-27T11:38:39.6700422Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:38:39.6701000Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:38:39.6701883Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:38:39.6703210Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:38:39.6704807Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
